From Coq Require Import ZArith List.
From compcert Require Import AST Ctypes Clight ClightBigstep Integers Values Memory Events.
Require Import WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_read_write.
Require Import WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_rest.
Require Import WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_lifecycle.
Require Import WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_local.
Set Printing Width 120.
Set Printing Depth 100000.
Set Default Timeout 60.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_read_write.scalar_writer_foot_block.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_read_write.eval_scalar_read_write_canonical.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_rest.scalar_normalize_rest_eq.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_rest.scalar_normalize_write_symbols.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_rest.exec_scalar_normalize_write.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_rest.exec_scalar_normalize_rest_canonical.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_lifecycle.scalar_normalize_entry.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_lifecycle.scalar_normalize_src_temp.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_lifecycle.scalar_normalize_public_body.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_lifecycle.eval_secp_scalar_normalize_canonical.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_local.scalar_normalize_local_spec.
Print WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_rest.scalar_normalize_write_stmt.
Print WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_rest.scalar_normalize_rest.
Print WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_normalize_lifecycle.scalar_normalize_temps.
